  <div class="importance" id="importance">
    <div class="text-importance">
      <h2 class="subheading">IMPORTANCE</h2>
      <ul class="list" type="disc">
        <li class="text-tags">
          Being leguminous, groundnut has the ability to fix atmospheric
          nitrogen biologically into the soil which enriches the soil and this
          benefits the succeeding crop in rotation.
        </li>
        <li class="text-tags">
          It can provide gainful employment during the lean season.
        </li>
        <li class="text-tags">
          Unlike the vegetables and fruits, which are highly perishable items,
          groundnuts can be stored for a long period of time and sold when
          prices are high.
        </li>
        <li class="text-tags">
          It provides a very nutritive green fodder (haulms) and feed (oil cake)
          which can be fed to cattle and also used as organic manures.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

